<title>USA: Wall Street opens higher.</title>
<headline>Wall Street opens higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street opened higher on Wednesday as markets added to gains after the Federal Reserve left interest rates unchanged yesterday.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials were up 18.96 at 7322.42 points and the Nasdaq Composite was up 10.02 at 1373.90.</p>
</text>
